# No unsolicited tests

Do not create, add, expand, or rewrite test files unless the user explicitly asked for tests in that request.

Help, fixes, and features mean production code only. Do not add a test “to be complete,” to prove a change, or because the feature recipe historically ended with tests.

If the user wants tests, they will say so (e.g. “add a test”, “cover this”, “write HTTP tests”).
